From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DE25-Nano port
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Poll screenshots with fixed video

The DE25 fixed fabric video path deliberately skips the Cyclone V video
initialization that drives Main's frame callbacks. Poll the screenshot worker
from user_io_poll on DE25 so FIFO screenshot requests can start and completed
images can be published even though no HPS scaler interrupt is present.

diff --git a/user_io.cpp b/user_io.cpp
--- a/user_io.cpp
+++ b/user_io.cpp
@@ -3224,7 +3224,13 @@ void user_io_poll()
 
 	// every frame, check if a screenshot has been requested.
 	// this is reduce risk of screenshot occurring while the scaler
 	// is being updated and getting a corrupted image.
+#ifdef MISTER_DE25
+	// The fixed fabric scaler has no Main-owned frame callback source.
+	// Polling here starts requests and publishes asynchronous completions.
+	screenshot_cb();
+#else
 	add_frame_callback(screenshot_cb);
+#endif
 
 	if ((core_type != CORE_TYPE_SHARPMZ) &&
 		(core_type != CORE_TYPE_8BIT))
-- 
